From: akol1 <15747200+akol1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:41:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui-workspace): keep an unstarted draft when a New Session
 starts

A New Session that starts without a preset opens a new Session and unmounts the blank the user was typing in, so the typed draft stays under the abandoned Session and the new composer is empty. Hand the abandoned blank drafts to the new Session's composer through conversation.input.handOffDraft before selection publishes, and keep the source draft when the target already holds input or its record cannot be written.

The hand-off reuses the structured DraftSnapshot path, writes the adopted draft beside the target's View preference, and drops the source key only after the target write succeeds. Attachments stay with the Session that owns their browser objects.
