 **Splitting persistence keys or adding a draft-management service.** The existing input owner and store can perform the work by sharing the input representation and import path.
 
+**Reusing the abandoned blank instead of carrying its draft.** Continuing the same mounted blank for every New Session coalesces unrelated creations into one Session and stays retired by the [Session-generation change](../../../../docs/upgrade-guide/v0.2.1-alpha.1/new-session-generations/guide.md); carrying the draft keeps each New Session independent while the user's unsent text follows the navigation.
